From: virtudude <virtudude@protonmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:11:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/11] ASoC: dt-bindings: qcom,wsa8840: add V/I guard and tweeter
 properties

Two board properties of a WSA884x speaker:

- qcom,vi-guard: the speaker may only be driven while the amplifier's
  V/I sense feeds speaker protection, so the driver keeps the PA off
  unless the V/I sense port streams.
- qcom,tweeter: the amplifier drives a tweeter, which speaker
  protection only runs behind a DSP high-pass (the SP module's own
  high-pass is a single ~80 Hz filter shared by all speakers).

